{"asset_key":"ep1/gameplay_story_11609000","episode":"ep1","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"11609000","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1160900001:1":{"text":"所有人都会认为蛮血只崇尚破坏性强的纯粹力量，这其实是个误区，至少我希望力量在荒角沙漠有更多可能。","source_cn":"所有人都会认为蛮血只崇尚破坏性强的纯粹力量，这其实是个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC688CD0465F5B5F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1160900002:1":{"text":"我的父亲是一名行脚商人，我从小跟着他见过很多蕴含力量的武器、卷轴、饰品，虽然它们都有各自的魅力，但比起魔饰都显得逊色很多。","source_cn":"我的父亲是一名行脚商人，我从小跟着他见过很多蕴含力量的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA55361017BD12642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1160900003:1":{"text":"魔饰由注入魔力的原石制成，可以让你在战场中发挥预料之外的力量，辅助你挖掘自身的潜力。","source_cn":"魔饰由注入魔力的原石制成，可以让你在战场中发挥预料之外...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5064AA59F253EC1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1160900004:1":{"text":"我希望它能到所有荣耀的战士手中，所以我决定做一名魔饰商人，把它们带回荒角沙漠！","source_cn":"我希望它能到所有荣耀的战士手中，所以我决定做一名魔饰商...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x257495F03E1735A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1160900005:1":{"text":"看看吧，无论是扬长还是避短，魔饰随意挑选！","source_cn":"看看吧，无论是扬长还是避短，魔饰随意挑选！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE75DB7A57852A834","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_f